rce reviewed, not run here. The inspected bridge sends env_seed when launching a binary, but reset(seed=...) sends only a reset message. Editor runs need scene/plugin seed control; validate reset repeatability rather than assuming the Python argument reseeds Godot.","limitations","guidance","list","配置步骤","ordered",true,"items",[79,80,81],"setup","Install godot-rl in a Python environment and download a documented example such as JumperHard.","Use the matching Godot 4 .NET editor for the documented editor example; import the project.","Run the repository Stable Baselines 3 example, or adapt its environment interface to a fixed policy.","可以尝试的任务",false,[86,87,88],"testTasks","Change movement or reward logic, establish reset/replay repeatability for that scene, then compare fixed input rollouts.","Test sensors, action scaling and Python-to-game synchronization.","Replace a character or collider and verify that observations and control still work.","AI 使用与评估条件","Designed for learning and automated gameplay testing. Keep imported-model rights and example attributions alongside the MIT toolkit license.","aiUseNote","links","参考依据",[96,97,98],"evidence",{"_58":103,"_25":104},{"_58":101,"_25":102},{"_58":99,"_25":100},"Pinned binary-launch and reset seed behavior","https://github.com/edbeeching/godot_rl_agents/blob/207b6f476f5846f33d08b92c7a350147e7b78bf5/godot_rl/core/godot_env.py","Example asset attribution","https://github.com/edbeeching/godot_rl_agents#license","Editor and exported-game workflow","https://github.com/edbeeching/godot_rl_agents#quickstart-guide","查看许可条款",[108],"licenseUrl",{"_58":105,"_25":109},"https://github.com/edbeeching/godot_rl_agents/blob/main/LICENSE","许可类别","代码与资产采用不同许可","terms","provenance","资产许可","Example assets can have separate notices: the Cartoon Plane model is CC BY 4.0.","assetLicense","代码许可","MIT for Godot RL Agents; Godot is also MIT.","codeLicense","开始使用",[123],"access",{"_58":124,"_25":104,"_125":126},"Free toolkit and example projects"